herit; line-height: inherit; text-decoration: inherit;" class=3D""> Credit =
repair is extremely effective. But results will vary GREATLY depending on y=
our own knowledge and the methodology you use to dispute items on your clie=
nt's reports.<br><br> Simply mailing off angry letters to the credit bureau=
s without fully understanding how their automated computer systems work wil=
l not yield positive results. =C2=A0<br><br> One of the main reasons credit=
